WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A generative tool speeds up drafts, outlines, comparison tables or first translations when you give it the real raw material. It does not replace your memory of your own work, nor does it decide a medical, legal or financial diagnosis.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.300
Goal: separate mechanical writing tasks from the decisions and facts that only the person knows.

3
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:40.300
Jorge wants to adapt his CV into English in ten minutes and has three tasks on the table. Your task: decide which part AI can speed up and which part Jorge must write or confirm.

4
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:47.100
Hint: the tool arranges words; it was not there on your warehouse shift.

5
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:54.300
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
